    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d426">

                <pb facs="0401" n="285" xml:id="pg285"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 322.112J72/4.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul General Goding
                        to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate General</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Guayaquil</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-03-11T16:00:00-05:14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 11, 1914, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Certified copies of the evidence and of brief in case of Jones in the Legation
                    since last Saturday. Carbon copies uncertified mailed to you March 9. Shall I
                    forward certified copies? Jones released under bonds to-day, starts immediately
                    to Washington, D. C.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Goding</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
